      "content": "thanks. so it's basically just the cocoa butter crystals being messy right? i've been trying to follow a standard tempering curve but i keep getting these weird white streaks that look almost like a film. is there anything else that could trigger that \"bloom\" effect besides just the temperature being off? like environmental stuff?",
